# OpenStreetMap layers, classified. Included from vibegis.map via:
#   INCLUDE "osm-layers.map"
#
# Currently empty — every LAYER block was removed on request. The database
# tables are untouched; re-add layers here (or re-register the tables through
# the upload panel) to bring them back. Conventions for when you do:
#
#   * Palette follows CORINE Land Cover, darkened for a night basemap:
#     vegetation green, agriculture olive, urban fabric red, commercial
#     orange-red, industry violet, extraction plum, water blue, bare ground grey.
#   * Every CLASS needs a NAME or it will not appear in GetLegendGraphic.
#   * CONNECTION carries no password: libpq takes it from PGPASSWORD, which
#     compose sets on the mapserver container from .env. This file is in git —
#     do not paste one back in.
